---
import { BellRing, CalendarCheck2, Globe2, LayoutDashboard, Percent } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="bsw-definition" aria-labelledby="bsw-definition-heading">
  <div class="bsw-definition__inner">
    <div class="bsw-definition__intro">
      <p class="bsw-definition__eyebrow">The basics</p>
      <h2 id="bsw-definition-heading" class="bsw-definition__heading">
        What is a barbershop website<span class="bsw-definition__period">?</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="bsw-definition__answer">
        A barbershop website is the dedicated online home for a barber or barbershop.
        It shows clients who you are, what services you offer, who works behind
        the chairs, where to find you and how to book. A professional site can use
        your own domain, reflect your shop's identity and connect directly to online
        booking. Unlike relying only on a profile within a third-party booking
        platform, a website gives your business its own place for customers to
        discover, explore and book.
      </p>

      <p class="bsw-definition__context">
        For an independent UK barbershop, that means your first impression, service
        information and booking journey can sit together under your brand.
        Full KERSIVO brings the website, online bookings and day-to-day barbershop
        tools into one connected experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bsw-definition__benefits" aria-label="Five practical benefits of a Full KERSIVO barbershop website">
      <article class="bsw-definition-benefit">
        <div class="bsw-definition-benefit__top">
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <Globe2 size={24} strokeWidth={1.7} />
          </span>
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Your brand. Your domain.</h3>
        <p>A professionally prepared website that reflects your shop, with one standard domain included.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bsw-definition-benefit">
        <div class="bsw-definition-benefit__top">
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <CalendarCheck2 size={24} strokeWidth={1.7} />
          </span>
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Bookings built in.</h3>
        <p>Clients choose a service, barber and available time through your own website.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bsw-definition-benefit">
        <div class="bsw-definition-benefit__top">
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <BellRing size={24} strokeWidth={1.7} />
          </span>
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Deposits & reminders.</h3>
        <p>Optional £5 booking deposits, email confirmations and appointment reminders by email and SMS.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bsw-definition-benefit">
        <div class="bsw-definition-benefit__top">
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <Percent size={24} strokeWidth={1.7} />
          </span>
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3>0% KERSIVO commission.</h3>
        <p>No KERSIVO commission on bookings or retail payments. Standard Stripe fees still apply.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bsw-definition-benefit">
        <div class="bsw-definition-benefit__top">
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <LayoutDashboard size={24} strokeWidth={1.7} />
          </span>
          <span class="bsw-definition-benefit__number" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        </div>
        <h3>More than a website.</h3>
        <p>Manage barbers, services and clients, with reports and a retail pickup shop.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
